  {
   "section": "19",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "TISAX Certification"
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 1,
   "repeats": []
  },
  {
   "section": "20",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "The TISAX certification (Trusted Information Security Assessment Exchange) is an industry standard defined and maintained by the German Association of the Automotive Industry (VDA) and ENX. The certification is based on the requirements of the VDA Information Security Assessment (ISA) and confirms that a company's information security management system fulfills defined security levels and demonstrates a high level of information security."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 1,
   "repeats": []
  },
  {
   "section": "21",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "TISAX Certification (Linde Material Handling, Aschaffenburg)",
     "href": "../../../media/Global-Content/08_Downloads/Certificates/TISAX-LMH.pdf"
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 0,
   "repeats": []
  },
  {
   "section": "22",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Information Security"
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 1,
   "repeats": []
  },
  {
   "section": "23",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "ISO 27001 is an international standard for information security management systems (ISMS). It specifies the requirements for the introduction, implementation, maintenance and continuous improvement of an information security management system, taking into account the context of an organization. The development, provision and operation of the my Linde software portal and the features it contains, as well as the Linde connect:desk fleet management solution and the directly associated IT platforms and IT services at the Linde Material Handling locations mentioned, are certified."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 1,
   "repeats": []
